                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cochain+cohomology"} cochain cohomology
                  respects
                  = succeed ";" do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/direct+sums"} direct sums
              %li
                %p
                  the third step uses that for
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/finite+groups"} finite groups
                  in
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/characteristic+zero"} characteristic zero
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/invariants"} invariants
                  is compatible with passing to
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cochain+cohomology"} cochain cohomology
                  (
                  %a{:href => "invariant#TakingInvariantsForFiniteGroupCommutesWithTaingHomologyInCharZero"}> this prop.
                  ):
              %li
                %p
                  the fourth step is the
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/K%C3%BCnneth+theorem"} Künneth theorem
                  for
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/ordinary+homology"} ordinary homology
                  over a
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/field"} field
                  (
                  %a{:href => "K&#252;nneth+theorem#InordinaryHomology"}> this prop.
                  ).
